      ],
      "text": "Frequency once per round\n\nRequirements The globetrotting scholar's last action was a successful Strike\n\n---\nEffect The globetrotting scholar immediately casts Gouging Claw, Ignition, or Tangle Vine at the target of the Strike.",
      "frequency": {
        "max": 1,
        "per": "round"
